  "event_seq": 103,
  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets doubled from ~600 to over 1,200/month starting August 2026 (F-05), not because dispute handling is slow (within SLA, F-01) or a tariff changed (none occurred, F-04), but because the billing import + validation step is issuing incorrect bills: the majority of disputed bills (1,785 of 3,025, ~59%) are built from ACTUAL meter reads rather than estimated ones (F-03), showing the defect occurs when accepted reads are processed into bills, not only when reads are missing. A field manual-read completion shortfall (0.88 vs 0.95 target, 9,200 accounts, F-02) is a secondary contributor driving estimate-substitution disputes for the remaining accounts."
 },
